# Production URL

The live site is `https://goldenspoon.xyz` with an empty `paths.base`. Do not set `GITHUB_PAGES`, do not use `/golden-spoon` as a base path, and do not link to `*.github.io`.

- Import `base` from `$app/paths` for `<a href>` attributes: `href="{base}/leagues"`.
- Use `` goto(`${base}/path`) `` for programmatic navigation.
- For auth/route guards, use `$page.route.id` (e.g. `/login`), not `$page.url.pathname`.
